libhangul
A library to support hangul input method logic, hanja dictionary and small
hangul character classification.

How to build
 From tarball
  $ ./configure
  $ make
  # make install

 From source repository
  $ ./autogen.sh
  $ ./configure
  $ make
  # make install

Download:
 * https://github.com/libhangul/libhangul/releases
 * Older releases
   https://code.google.com/archive/p/libhangul/downloads

